    "message": "0.6.0 finds copies that 0.5.0 misses: in code that was not built with the analyzers, through `MemberwiseClone`, and through `RuntimeHelpers.GetObjectValue`. A library built with 0.5.0 is treated as unchecked by 0.6.0 and later, so update and rebuild.",
    "reasons": [
      "Other"
    ]
  },
